      "id": "minimal",
      "description": "The smallest catalog MSF-01 admits for a video track: version (5.1.1, a String, here \"draft-01\" by the 'draft-XX' convention 5.1.1 states) and tracks (5.1.4); for the track name (5.2.3), packaging (5.2.4) and isLive (5.2.7), all Required: Yes, plus codec (5.2.18) and bitrate (5.2.22), which are Conditional and MUST be present on a video track.",
      "input": {
        "text": "{\"version\": \"draft-01\", \"tracks\": [{\"name\": \"video\", \"packaging\": \"loc\", \"isLive\": true, \"role\": \"video\", \"codec\": \"av01\", \"bitrate\": 1500000}]}"
      },
